#               02-Apr-2020 RD: Jump back in case of MPRXTR problem
#               06-Apr-2020 AV: Replace old NAV merge with INIT_BRD
#               16-Apr-2020 RD: V_SP3INT added (sampling in STDPRE)
#               20-May-2020 MK: Switched to IGb14
